  "articleSummary": ""In a recent statement to the press, President Donald Trump claimed that he spoke with a former presidential executive who reportedly expressed regret in a private conversation about not attacking Iran when they occupied the Oval Office. This claim contradicts official statements given by representatives for each of the four living former presidents—three Democrats and one Republican—who stated none have been in contact with Trump recently since his inauguration on January 20, 2025.",
